.TH audacity 1
.SH NAME
audacity \- AuTopsy audio editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B audacity
[
.I AUDIO-FILE
]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B AuTopsy
is an independent audio editor based on Audacity's audacity3 branch.
The Windows build also provides native video tracks and synchronized preview.
It generally does not support
command line options, outside of opening files. 

Documentation and support can be found on 
https://github.com/Ceratops-Code/AuTopsy

The upstream audio manual can be found on
https://manual.audacityteam.org/

